            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>For the past 7 years, The Roanoke Valley Community Health Initiative has made inroads in the fight against obesity in Halifax County. The group has leveraged valuable resources to maximize collective impact in the Roanoke Valley. The Health Initiative's work continues to be a catalyst for positive change across the region.</AbstractText>
